# Model placement

Four homes — **do not duplicate** types across them.

## Features (`Application/Features/`)

**Slice DTOs** (`DTOs.cs`) — shared read shapes within one slice:

| Folder | Types |
|--------|-------|
| `Users/` | `SessionDto` |
| `ChatThreads/` | `ChatThreadDto` |
| `ChatMessages/` | `ChatMessageDto` |
| `UserSettings/` | `GeneralSettingsDto`, `EmailSettingsDto` |
| `Shared/` | Cross-slice DTOs |

`FromEntity(Core.Entities.*)` for mapping; `AsResponse<T>()` when Response inherits the DTO.

**Use-case types** (`Commands|Queries/{UseCase}.cs`):

| Kind | Pattern |
|------|---------|
| Message | `{UseCase}Request` |
| Result | `{UseCase}Response` (may extend slice DTO) |
| Validator | `{UseCase}RequestValidator` |
| Handler | `{UseCase}RequestHandler` |

Do **not** put use-case types in `Infrastructure/` or `WebApp/Models/`.

## Infrastructure (`Infrastructure/{Concern}/`)

Integration ports and models — **`Abstractions.cs`** (interfaces + contract constants) and **`DTOs.cs`** per concern folder:

| Folder | `DTOs.cs` | `Abstractions.cs` |
|--------|-----------|-------------------|
| `Mailbox/` | `InboxQuery`, `MailboxStatusResult`, … | `IMailboxService` |
| `Foundry/` | `FoundryOptions` | `IFoundryAgentFactory`, `FoundryDeployments` |

Implementations in the same folder (`MailKitMailboxService`, `FoundryAgentFactory`). Helpers in **`Helpers.cs`** per concern (internal types + public `EmailSettingsJsonHelpers`).

## Core (`Core/Entities/`)

DB-mapped POCOs and entity-owned types (e.g. `EmailSettings` on `UserSetting`). No data annotations — column limits in `Core/Database/` + EF fluent config; input rules on Feature `Request` validators.

## Application (`Application/Models/`) — app layer

| File | Types |
|------|-------|
| `AI.cs` | `RunChatAgentRequest/Response` |
| `Constants.cs` | `ChatMessageRoles` |

## WebApp (`WebApp/Models/`) — UI shell

| File | Types |
|------|-------|
| `Enums.cs` | `SettingsSection` |
| `Constants.cs` | `AuthConstants` |

## Decision tree

1. Single use-case pair? → Features file
2. Shared read shape in one slice? → `Features/{Slice}/DTOs.cs`
3. Shared across slices? → `Features/Shared/DTOs.cs`
4. Mailbox / Foundry integration shape? → `Infrastructure/{Concern}/DTOs.cs`
5. `Result` / `ErrorCode`? → `MediatR.Results`
6. AI turn shapes? → `Application/Models/AI.cs`
7. DB entity? → `Core/Entities/`

Handler/repo conventions: **`feature-slice-conventions.mdc`**.
